fsync EIO: error 5, the document as it was, session folders 1, the first checkpoint, temporary 0
the session folder's fsync EIO: 1, the document as it was, session folders 1, the edit, temporary 0
nothing failed: 0, the document as it was, session folders 1, the edit, temporary 0
----
end
