CRLF then LF: error 84 CRLF [<195><169> caf<195><169>\r\n<240><159><152><128>] cursor 13
a surrogate's bytes: error 84 CRLF [<195><169> caf<195><169>\r\n<240><159><152><128>] cursor 13
a C1 control: error 84 CRLF [<195><169> caf<195><169>\r\n<240><159><152><128>] cursor 13
undo: 1 CRLF [<195><169> caf<195><169>\r\n] cursor 9
plain newlines, then CR LF then LF: error 84 LF [a\nb] cursor 0
a load with a redo waiting: 0 LF [loaded] cursor 0
undo 0, redo 0 LF [loaded] cursor 0
----
